{"fact_id": "fact_cc25b1bc3d18", "statement": "异常检测（YOLOX 检测 + HF²-VAD）在 7 段含异常事件的测试视频上取得 AUROC 92.1%", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 1, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E001", "statistic": "an area under the curve of 92.1%", "quote": "To evaluate the proposed abnormal behaviour detection model, it is tested on 7 videos which result in an area under the curve of 92.1%.", "supports_claim": "自监督视频异常检测能有效筛选含异常行为的帧", "claim_strength": "direct", "limitations": "", "page": 1}}
{"fact_id": "fact_48ead41270f3", "statement": "Byte³Track 跟踪性能：2.5 分钟视频平均 MOTA 87.7%、MOTP 80.4%、IDF1 90.8%、HOTA 72.0%；5 分钟视频 MOTA 85.4%、MOTP 82.6%、IDF1 89.1%、HOTA 72.5%", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 0, "last_called_at": null, "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E002", "statistic": "87.7% MOTA, 80.4% MOTP, 90.8% IDF1 and 72.0% HOTA", "quote": "obtaining 87.7% MOTA, 80.4% MOTP, 90.8% IDF1 and 72.0% HOTA scores on average for the 2.5-minute videos, and 85.4% MOTA, 82.6% MOTP, 89.1% IDF1 and 72.5% HOTA scores for the 5-minute video, respectively.", "supports_claim": "改进后的跟踪器在自建火鸡数据上达到所述跟踪精度", "claim_strength": "direct", "limitations": "", "page": 1}}
{"fact_id": "fact_05f9a32d58ec", "statement": "与原版 ByteTrack 相比（2.5 分钟视频平均）：MOTA +8.2、MOTP +0.3、IDF1 +2.7、HOTA +2.2 个百分点，身份切换数 N_ID 减少 166", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 1, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:17+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E003", "statistic": "improved MOTA by 8.2%", "quote": "Compared to ByteTrack, the proposed tracker improved MOTA by 8.2%,MOTP by 0.3%,IDF1 by 2.7%,HOTA by 2.2%,and reduced \\( {\\mathrm{N}}_{\\mathrm{ID}} \\) by 166 in the 2.5-minute videos on the average.", "supports_claim": "第三步关联使跟踪指标整体优于原版 ByteTrack", "claim_strength": "direct", "limitations": "", "page": 8}}
{"fact_id": "fact_cfb6611dc088", "statement": "消融（2.5 分钟平均，表 3）：modIoU 版 MOTA 87.682 / IDF1 90.849 / HOTA 71.95，优于 IoU 版（80.615 / 88.563 / 70.098）与原版 ByteTrack（79.493 / 88.173 / 69.782）", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 2, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E004", "statistic": "87.682", "quote": "modIoU score outperforms the original ByteTrack implementation and the proposed implementation based on IoU in contrast to modIoU in MOTA, MOTP, IDF1, and HOTA scores.", "supports_claim": "第三步关联与 modIoU 分别有正贡献", "claim_strength": "direct", "limitations": "", "page": 5}}
{"fact_id": "fact_a116a64934f8", "statement": "modIoU 版并非全指标占优：2.5 分钟消融中其 N_ID=169，高于 IoU 版的 140（表 3）——modIoU 以更多身份切换换取整体跟踪性能", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 3, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E005", "statistic": "169", "quote": "Nevertheless, although to use of IoU leads to fewer identity switches, it underperforms in tracking.", "supports_claim": "“modIoU 全面更优”不成立，N_ID 指标上 IoU 变体更好", "claim_strength": "conflicting", "limitations": "", "page": 8}}
{"fact_id": "fact_fe8f5b873066", "statement": "5 分钟视频基准（表 6）：Byte³Track 五项指标全部最佳（MOTA 85.431、MOTP 82.563、IDF1 89.128、HOTA 72.523、N_ID 78）", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 1, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E006", "statistic": "85.431", "quote": "As shown in Table 6,the Byte \\( {}^3 \\) Track algorithm obtains the best results on all evaluation metrics when tested on the 5-minute video.", "supports_claim": "Byte³Track 在较长视频上保持最优跟踪性能", "claim_strength": "direct", "limitations": "", "page": 9}}
{"fact_id": "fact_de79fe9b29a3", "statement": "遮挡个例（图 5）：火鸡身体大部被遮挡时，靠仍可见的头部在第 846 帧被重识别，ByteTrack 则赋予新 ID", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#08", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 2, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E007", "statistic": "", "quote": "It was able to reidentify the turkey, since its head remained visible during the occlusion event.", "supports_claim": "基于头部的第三步关联可缓解遮挡造成的目标丢失", "claim_strength": "direct", "limitations": "", "page": 6}}
{"fact_id": "fact_149263c2d134", "statement": "检测数据集规模：人工标注 1,808 帧、共 35,489 只火鸡；头部区域标注由颜色范围与闭运算自动生成", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 2, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E008", "statistic": "1,808 frames containing 35,489 turkeys", "quote": "First, a turkey detection dataset is created by manually annotating 1,808 frames containing 35,489 turkeys.", "supports_claim": "本研究自建数据的规模与构成", "claim_strength": "background", "limitations": "", "page": 2}}
{"fact_id": "fact_3f8620933ca6", "statement": "异常检测数据：训练集 8 段视频（每段 300 帧、30 fps、仅正常行为、无标注）；测试集 7 段、共 2,167 帧、带帧级标注", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 1, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E009", "statistic": "300 frames with a frame rate of 30 frames/second", "quote": "The applied datasets for training and evaluating the anomaly detection model contain 8 training videos and 7 testing videos.", "supports_claim": "异常检测的训练/测试协议构成", "claim_strength": "background", "limitations": "", "page": 5}}
{"fact_id": "fact_a86e30097d19", "statement": "作者自述局限：头部区域采用自动标注，其边界框可能不如人工标注准确；作者预期人工标注训练可带来更好性能", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#12", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 4, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E010", "statistic": "", "quote": "Most likely, this may have resulted in less accurate bounding boxes than when using manual annotation.", "supports_claim": "头部自动标注的精度上限是结果的一个约束", "claim_strength": "background", "limitations": "头部区域自动标注的边界框可能不如人工标注准确（作者自述）", "page": 9}}
{"fact_id": "fact_07030cae6e2f", "statement": "作者自述局限：系统只检测异常行为、不将其分类到具体行为类别，分类留作未来工作", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#12", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 3, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E011", "statistic": "", "quote": "detects abnormal behaviour only and does not classify this into specific behavioural classes.", "supports_claim": "本文方法的输出边界是异常帧筛选而非行为分类", "claim_strength": "background", "limitations": "只检测异常行为、不分类具体行为类别（作者自述）", "page": 9}}
