{"fact_id": "fact_0c5017d20256", "statement": "跟踪阈值经附录 A 逐参数扫描选定且两套时长取值不同：2.5 分钟视频 θ_modIoU=0.99、θ_high=0.7、θ_low=0.68；5 分钟视频 θ_modIoU=0.95、θ_high=0.4、θ_low=0.3", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 4, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E013", "statistic": "= {0.99}", "quote": "Based on the results in Table A.2,we have chosen for \\( {\\theta }_{\\text{ high }} = {0.7} \\) .", "supports_claim": "报告性能依赖按视频时长调定的阈值", "claim_strength": "indirect", "limitations": "", "page": 10}}
{"fact_id": "fact_89ff0bca0377", "statement": "训练配置：HF²-VAD 沿用 Ped2 参数（batch size 128、80 epochs、w_r=1.0、w_p=0.1、k=4）；YOLOX 训练 400 epochs、batch 16；硬件为 RTX5000（16 GB）服务器", "fact_type": "evidence", "object_id": "paper:abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598", "valid_at": "2026-10-20", "invalid_at": null, "created_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00", "expired_at": null, "reference_time": null, "provenance": [{"source_package": "literature", "source_artifact": "证据表.jsonl", "source_anchor": "Literature/abnormal-turkey-behaviour-detection-usin_f65598/阅读笔记.md#10", "source_version": "00adccc505d1a311c1638e098e72c1b7ae383855402833d7fb73c82282e45c90", "ingested_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:15+00:00"}], "status": "current", "superseded_by": null, "supersedes": null, "derived_from": [], "stale": false, "stale_reason": null, "strength": {"calls": 1, "last_called_at": "2026-10-20T14:08:18+00:00", "dormant": false}, "extra": {"evidence_id": "E014", "statistic": "the batch size is 128 , the number of epochs is 80", "quote": "Moreover,we set \\( k = 4 \\) ,meaning that the four preceding frames are employed to predict the next frame during training and testing.", "supports_claim": "复现所需的关键实现条件", "claim_strength": "background", "limitations": "", "page": 6}}
